<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed lower in heavy trading.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 35.73 to 7654.25</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 1.97 to 460.93.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.19.</p>
<p>Decliners beat advancers 1455 to 1300.</p>
<p>Volume was 499,780,900 compared with 603,019,530 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1645 EST/2045 GMT).</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
